Service -> Service: 9: Require explicit separate verification decision
Service --> API: 10: Evidence available for human review
API --> Page: 11: HTTP 200: Evidence available for human review
Page --> Actor: 12: Show authorized result
deactivate Service
else Invalid input, missing session or insufficient role
API --> Page: 4.1: HTTP 422 / 401 / 403 (429 only if rate-limited)
Page --> Actor: 4.2: Show appropriate error; retain form/draft
end
deactivate API
deactivate Page

